      "organization": "OpenScales Project",
      "date": "2026-06-17",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
      "notes": "Bilingual English/German. English items from userpage.fu-berlin.de/~health/; German items from the FU-Berlin skalen documentation. 4-point response (1-4). No reverse-coded items. Source does not state sum vs mean; sum used (range 12-48), mean also common. English and German map 1:1; no reverse items."
    },
